@* Two filters that belong together - a "from" and its "to". They are never split across a row boundary:
   side by side where the row is wide enough, one under the other where it is not.

   Left to flow with the other fields, a pair broke apart whenever it happened to begin in the last column,
   which put "Size from" at the end of one row and "Size to" at the start of the next. *@

<div class="fieldpair">
    @ChildContent
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
